msgctxt "66\t244"
msgid ""
"Many people stood in our way as we\\n"
"continued our investigation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280\t425"
msgid ""
"Futo Shimano, who was after both the 10\\n"
"billion and the position of chairman..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "455\t555"
msgid "We meet at last, Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568\t727"
msgid ""
"Goro Majima, lieutenant of\\n"
"the Shimano Family..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "750\t860"
msgid "Hey, Kazzy. I've been lookin' for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892\t1065"
msgid ""
"Our fight against the hard<Sign:22>bitten veterans\\n"
"of many yakuza wars was as fierce as ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1063\t1285"
msgid ""
"Lastly, there was Yayoi, wife of Sohei\\n"
"Dojima, the man who was murdered in 1995."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1286\t1360"
msgid "Are you the one who killed my husband?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1373\t1500"
msgid "Her words hung heavy on my heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1529\t1660"
msgid ""
"And yet there were also people who\\n"
"tried to help me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1692\t1843"
msgid ""
"Kazuki, the owner of the host bar,\\n"
"Stardust, and one of the hosts, Yuya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1854\t1916"
msgid "Terada from the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1940\t2084"
msgid ""
"These people, whom I met through\\n"
"my father, gave me courage to go on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2092\t2119"
msgid "And finally..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2140\t2299"
msgid ""
"I met a man who helped me get to the\\n"
"bottom of what had happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2310\t2450"
msgid ""
"Kazuma Kiryu. You didn't waste any time\\n"
"making a name for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2490\t2552"
msgid "His name was Kage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2589\t2692"
msgid ""
"He was a legendary information dealer\\n"
"who worked in Kamurocho's underground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2718\t2810"
msgid "I've got video of that bar, Serena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2826\t3012"
msgid ""
"Kage's information led us to the man who\\n"
"had been controlling everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3030\t3178"
msgid ""
"Kage thought he might be a member of a\\n"
"secret government organization."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3179\t3393"
msgid ""
"When I looked into it, I discovered an\\n"
"underground government agency called MIA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3394\t3590"
msgid ""
"A politician had been involved with the\\n"
"stolen 10 billion yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3606\t3666"
msgid "His name was Jingu Kyohei."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3676\t3811"
msgid ""
"He had given the money to the Tojo Clan\\n"
"as part of an investment scheme."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3829\t3939"
msgid ""
"Jingu had been using the Tojo Clan to\\n"
"make money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3962\t4156"
msgid ""
"The people who had stolen the money had\\n"
"done so to protect the Tojo Clan from Jingu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4169\t4215"
msgid "But who were they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4230\t4433"
msgid ""
"Kazuma... We stole the money.\\n"
"Me, Yumi, and Sera..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4469\t4558"
msgid "At last, I had discovered the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4572\t4594"
msgid "However..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4649\t4680"
msgid "Yaaaa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4700\t4760"
msgid "Haruka! Pop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4769\t4878"
msgid "After sacrificing his life to save Haruka..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4960\t5034"
msgid "...my father told me everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5178\t5535"
msgid ""
"Forgive me, Kazuma.\\n"
"I'm the one... who killed your parents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5610\t5690"
msgid "It's all right. It's all right, Pop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5755\t6120"
msgid "You'll... You'll always be my father!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6159\t6298"
msgid ""
"After revealing the secret that he had\\n"
"kept for so long..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6308\t6420"
msgid "...my father passed away."
msgstr ""